  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-ded6cf9529217b5f4f825a1f",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于开环传递函数具有 P=0 的系统，闭环稳定性取决于奈奎斯特图对 (-1, j0) 点的包围情况。随着 K 的变化，包围圈数发生改变，从而导致不同的稳定区域。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For a system with open-loop transfer function having P=0, the closed-loop stability depends on the encirclements of the (-1, j0) point by the Nyquist plot. As K varies, the number of encirclements changes, leading to different stability regions.",
